-- Murder Mystery Utility Hub (Single LocalScript)
-- Place in StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts in YOUR Roblox Studio game.
-- H = toggle menu; X = close permanently.
--
-- Includes:
-- * Player list + teleport to selected player
-- * Player ESP outlines + names + tool-based hints
-- * Scan player tools (Knife / Gun / Revolver)
-- * Find dropped weapon Tools/Models and teleport to them
-- * Adjustable WalkSpeed
-- * No-clip toggle with collision restoration
--
-- Note: A LocalScript cannot securely remove a weapon from another player's
-- server-controlled inventory. A real transfer needs your game's server logic.

